  {
    "id": "288996cd-f559-4d90-aa3f-fcbf243d86e5",
    "title": "Tabbin Version 2",
    "content": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: var(--ink);\">wow nakakapag version 2 na ngani HASHSAHASHSA sana ma launch na or mapost na</span></p><div><b>Tabbin Version 2.1</b></div><div><ul><li><strike>Added option to change the looks</strike></li><li><strike>added settings panel (dock side, startup, save location, design, clear)</strike></li><li><strike>added ability to choose which edge</strike></li></ul></div><div><b>Tabbin Version 2.2</b></div><div><ul><li>Bring back old classic notes look for Clear (Classic) View. </li><li>Change name from Clear to Classic</li><li>Drop the current \"glass\" view and change the name of \"bare\" to \"glass\"</li><li>allow the ability to drag from the dock to the screen </li><li>add hotkeys or shortcut keys for strikethrough, bullet, indents, turn numbered list automatically, shortcuts for align left, center, right</li></ul><p></p></div>",
    "color": "#b9a7e8",
    "updatedAt": 1791268679550,
    "alwaysOnTop": false
  },
  {
    "id": "a6f57c8d-668e-4437-bce0-1cb6044f1f6a",
    "title": "Tabbin Notes",
    "content": "<i>This note contains all the fixes and feature upgrades for the next version release.</i><div><i style=\"background-color: transparent;\"><b>Fixes:</b></i></div><div><ol><li><br></li></ol></div><div><i><b>Features</b></i></div><div><ol><li><i>allow second monitor capabilities</i></li><li><i>make the UI better</i></li><ul><li><i>notes window</i></li><ul><li><i>color picker</i></li><li><i>delete button</i></li></ul><li><i>dock (tabs, search layout)</i></li><li><i>delete confirmation</i></li></ul><li>allow compatibility/download for macOs then linux</li><li><br></li></ol><span style=\"background-color: transparent;\">note: when downloaded, there is a warning saying tabbin is not commonly downloaded and make sure it is trustworthy before installing. nis there a way we can bypass this now? brainstorm with me</span></div><div><span style=\"background-color: transparent;\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"background-color: transparent;\"><b><i>Short-Term Improvements:</i></b></span><span style=\"background-color: transparent;\"><ul><li><span style=\"background-color: transparent;\">Cross-platform support - The macOS builds are already configured (electron-builder --mac), but would need testing on macOS</span></li><li><span style=\"background-color: transparent;\">Performance optimization - Monitor memory/CPU usage during extended sessions</span></li><li><span style=\"background-color: transparent;\">Keyboard shortcuts - Add hotkeys for common actions (new note, hide dock, etc.)</span></li></ul></span></div><div><span style=\"background-color: transparent;\"><b><i>Medium-Term Enhancements:</i></b></span></div><div><ul><li><span style=\"background-color: transparent;\">Sync capability - Consider adding cloud sync via GitHub Gists or a dedicated service</span></li><li><span style=\"background-color: transparent;\">Themes - Allow custom color schemes beyond the preset tab colors</span></li><li><span style=\"background-color: transparent;\">Search improvements - Fuzzy search, tag filtering, etc.</span></li></ul></div><div><span style=\"background-color: transparent;\"><i><b>Long-Term Vision:</b></i>\n<ul><li><span style=\"background-color: transparent;\">Plugin architecture - Allow extensions for different note types</span><br></li><li><span style=\"background-color: transparent;\">Mobile companion app - View/manage notes on mobile devices</span><br></li><li><span style=\"background-color: transparent;\">Team collaboration - Shared workspaces (if demand exists)</span><br></li></ul></span><span style=\"background-color: transparent;\"><br></span></div>",
    "color": "#8EC5E8",
    "updatedAt": 1789359589693,
    "alwaysOnTop": false
  },
  {
    "id": "4f30d5ad-e614-41cc-8179-fdf18a5d3f69",
